The [[Sith Lord]] [[Anakin Skywalker|Darth Vader]] had a '''throne room''' within his personal residence, [[Fortress Vader]], on the [[planet]] [[Mustafar]]. From the room, Vader was able to overlook the landscape of Mustafar and receive [[hologram]] communications.<ref name="Part III" />

